If a fee was agreed, these rights start when that fee is paid.

2. What a buyer may not do

A buyer may not, and may not let anyone else:

  a. sell, rent, lend, give away, publish, or sublicense the Software or its source code;
  b. upload the source code to a public website or a public code host;
  c. remove or change this copyright notice;
  d. use the source to build a product that they sell or give to other schools.

3. Ownership

Paying for a copy does not transfer copyright. ScottsTechX remains the owner
